# P5-135 (accordproject/concerto-rust#516): raw fuzz outputs (the per-case
# *.jsonl files, triage clusters, shard directories' other files) are not
# committed. They go into a tarball on a draft release
# (migration/bench/bin/archive-results.mjs, then gh release upload;
# migration/bench/bin/fetch-results.sh restores them). Only the run
# summaries below stay in git; this mirrors keepInGit() in archive-results.mjs.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!MANIFEST
!*.md
!run-summary.json
!divergence-summary.json
!commits.json
!state.json
!run-42.json
